{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9UdXJraXNoLUxhbmd1YWdlL0Fub25zJTIwJTI4MjAxNyUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Anons","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/pbv0MSL9JKwu06CsaTrLCppkARR.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7hxJebQVniAo93o5YIl9RDG7vk4.jpg","description":"May 22nd, 1963. Unhappy with the existing social and political situation in Turkey, a group of military officers has planned a coup d’état to take down the government in Ankara. Meanwhile in Istanbul, their conspirators have undertaken the vital mission of taking over the National Radio station and making a formal announcement about the coup. But nothing goes to plan. Faced with a number of obstacles, including a sudden rainstorm, the absence of the radio station technician, a betrayal, the lack of feedback from Ankara and their very own inefficiency, the conspirators scramble to keep their plan on track and announce the success of the coup – that is, if the coup in the capital has taken place at all.","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["Drama","Others"],"imdbRating":"6.1","runtime":"94 min","cast":["Ali Seçkiner Alıcı","Murat Kılıç","Tarhan Karagöz","Şencan Güleryüz","Serkan Ercan","Erdem Şenocak","Mehmet Yılmaz Ak","Sanem Öge"],"director":["Mahmut Fazıl Coşkun"],"released":"2017-12-29T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"The night long journey of the 4 soldiers discharged from the army.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Ali Seçkiner Alıcı","character":"Albay Reha","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/se3ccNBI00d0t4imxP5Kskd8IKk.jpg"},{"name":"Murat Kılıç","character":"Binbaşı Kemal","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3XCEZgIYMcIItG12nmriVXqqLNC.jpg"},{"name":"Tarhan Karagöz","character":"Teğmen Şinasi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/67EsjfjRIRtOptqAJPbmq7BhG16.jpg"},{"name":"Şencan Güleryüz","character":"Binbaşı Rıfat","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5kwHSpjNXpfepQbd8Zyi6Nm70GG.jpg"},{"name":"Serkan Ercan","character":"Ha